{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Workflow Engine.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Workflow Engine.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"workflow engine workflow engine","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Workflow Engine.md","fileName":"Workflow Engine.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Workflow Engine","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-08 22:09\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Azure Logic Apps and Functions]] [[Cloud Business Process Automation]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Azure Logic Apps and Functions","Cloud Business Process Automation","c8andnetcore30projectsusingazure.pdf","cloudcomputing_mit.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Workflow Engine.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Workflow Engine.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"workflow engine workflow engine","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Workflow Engine.md","fileName":"Workflow Engine.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Workflow Engine","heading":"Workflow Engine","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A workflow engine coordinates a sequence of independent components at a high level. It starts from a trigger, passes data through actions, and can branch or repeat work without requiring the entire process to be implemented as one custom program.\n\nThe book presents Azure Logic Apps as a graphical workflow engine whose prebuilt components can connect services such as Excel, OneDrive, Twitter, and Azure Functions. An HTTP call provides an escape hatch when a required operation is not available as a built-in component.\n\nA workflow engine can also orchestrate a cloud business process whose components include software services, information sources, automated actions, and human steps. Its value depends on explicit triggers, interfaces, conditions, and completion measures rather than automation alone.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Azure Logic Apps and Functions","Cloud Business Process Automation","c8andnetcore30projectsusingazure.pdf","cloudcomputing_mit.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Workflow Engine.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Workflow Engine.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"workflow engine workflow engine","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Workflow Engine.md","fileName":"Workflow Engine.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Workflow Engine","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[c8andnetcore30projectsusingazure.pdf]]\n\n[[cloudcomputing_mit.epub]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Azure Logic Apps and Functions","Cloud Business Process Automation","c8andnetcore30projectsusingazure.pdf","cloudcomputing_mit.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}